      <h1>Build and run an import-free Wasm provider with Rust</h1>
      <p><strong>Supported in v0.7.0 — pre-production.</strong> You will create an import-free <code>text.uppercase</code> provider, compile it as a WebAssembly Component, inspect its interface, and invoke it with <code>dekopon-run</code>.</p>
      <p>Broker installation and HTTP-capable providers are covered as next steps, not implemented end to end here.</p>
